{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NEON INFERNO</strong></i> is a hybrid side-scroller and gallery-shooter where the action takes place in both the foreground and the background. As warring factions battle for control of a dystopian New York City, you enter the fray as an assassin for the Family -- a notorious crime syndicate determined to eliminate its rivals and dominate the metropolitan battlefield. Rendered in beautiful pixel art and backed by an evocative soundtrack, <i>Neon Inferno</i> delivers a stylish, modern 2D action experience with cyberpunk flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/6b45096043c54ce90b7d10420c1f8438.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/6b45096043c54ce90b7d10420c1f8438.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/6b45096043c54ce90b7d10420c1f8438.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELECT YOUR KILLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Angelo Morano or Mariana Vitti and battle through the streets, blasting, deflecting, and slicing your way through your enemies! With multiple upgrades and weapon options to choose from, you'll be well-equipped to shift this city-wide conflict in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/d08b5f3d8b95f6cd76c4b25117298aae.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/d08b5f3d8b95f6cd76c4b25117298aae.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/d08b5f3d8b95f6cd76c4b25117298aae.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT CLOSE, AIM FAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with traditional run-and-gun action, you'll be able to attack your enemies in both the foreground and the background, deflect their projectiles back at them using &quot;Bullet Time&quot;, and commandeer vehicles to chase down your targets! Choose your level of difficulty or challenge yourself in the 1-credit-clear Arcade Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/332f4af63d7c3df9daa18a1d659511cb.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/332f4af63d7c3df9daa18a1d659511cb.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/332f4af63d7c3df9daa18a1d659511cb.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A JOINT OPERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and expand The Family's reign across the city together! With double the characters and double the firepower, there's no limit to the carnage you can cause!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/0ace37e109bb8c983999600821b8fab1.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/0ace37e109bb8c983999600821b8fab1.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/0ace37e109bb8c983999600821b8fab1.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TARGETS ACQUIRED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go up against a rogue's gallery of unruly bosses, one at the end of every mission. Each boss is totally unique, featuring many attacks and multiple phases that will truly put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/82b76e627d2f1f9953a7af781345d002.avif?t=1768838481\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Neophyte","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/76ca2da3618d5ecc77b55193e861deaa55a329f4.jpg"},{"name":"Heat of the Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/76ca2da3618d5ecc77b55193e861deaa55a329f4.jpg"},{"name":"Baptised in Flame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/76ca2da3618d5ecc77b55193e861deaa55a329f4.jpg"},{"name":"A Fatal Overture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/76ca2da3618d5ecc77b55193e861deaa55a329f4.jpg"},{"name":"One to the Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/76ca2da3618d5ecc77b55193e861deaa55a329f4.jpg"},{"name":"Night of the Hunters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/76ca2da3618d5ecc77b55193e861deaa55a329f4.jpg"},{"name":"Every Hour Wounds...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/46910dc3eb41eed3f13ec0ee7d401bf6db737db9.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Star Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/a87c0cf185c5dc4dffdfd097e505a6b93ce058ed.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Crime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/232339bfbb7863b38c76770194d5145e5406c329.jpg"},{"name":"Marksman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2957720/3a26b1c904073db2cb0d52f7b5249eb8e5a9566e.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2957720?t=1768838481","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768838481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/3950f4065a866c266798fccc30de766eff4327fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768838481","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/3950f4065a866c266798fccc30de766eff4327fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768838481","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains cartoon 2D violence, with small amounts of blood and a few gruesome death screams."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3509220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NEON INFERNO</strong></i> is a hybrid side-scroller and gallery-shooter where the action takes place in both the foreground and the background. As warring factions battle for control of a dystopian New York City, you enter the fray as an assassin for the Family -- a notorious crime syndicate determined to eliminate its rivals and dominate the metropolitan battlefield. Rendered in beautiful pixel art and backed by an evocative soundtrack, <i>Neon Inferno</i> delivers a stylish, modern 2D action experience with cyberpunk flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/6b45096043c54ce90b7d10420c1f8438.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/6b45096043c54ce90b7d10420c1f8438.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/6b45096043c54ce90b7d10420c1f8438.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELECT YOUR KILLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Angelo Morano or Mariana Vitti and battle through the streets, blasting, deflecting, and slicing your way through your enemies! With multiple upgrades and weapon options to choose from, you'll be well-equipped to shift this city-wide conflict in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/d08b5f3d8b95f6cd76c4b25117298aae.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/d08b5f3d8b95f6cd76c4b25117298aae.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/d08b5f3d8b95f6cd76c4b25117298aae.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT CLOSE, AIM FAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with traditional run-and-gun action, you'll be able to attack your enemies in both the foreground and the background, deflect their projectiles back at them using &quot;Bullet Time&quot;, and commandeer vehicles to chase down your targets! Choose your level of difficulty or challenge yourself in the 1-credit-clear Arcade Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/332f4af63d7c3df9daa18a1d659511cb.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/332f4af63d7c3df9daa18a1d659511cb.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/332f4af63d7c3df9daa18a1d659511cb.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A JOINT OPERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and expand The Family's reign across the city together! With double the characters and double the firepower, there's no limit to the carnage you can cause!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/0ace37e109bb8c983999600821b8fab1.poster.avif?t=1768838481\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/0ace37e109bb8c983999600821b8fab1.webm?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/0ace37e109bb8c983999600821b8fab1.mp4?t=1768838481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TARGETS ACQUIRED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go up against a rogue's gallery of unruly bosses, one at the end of every mission. Each boss is totally unique, featuring many attacks and multiple phases that will truly put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/extras/82b76e627d2f1f9953a7af781345d002.avif?t=1768838481\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p>","developers":["Zenovia Interactive"],"dlc":[4140480],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957720/header.jpg?t=1768838481","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Zenovia Interactive, LLC<br />\r\n\u00a9 2025 Screenwave Media Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2957720/1778612123/dc2bfcc2ce0a99af3addffa4e4d7f0abfc0b31e7/1768582787/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768583744","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2957720/1778612123/dc2bfcc2ce0a99af3addffa4e4d7f0abfc0b31e7/1768582787/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768583744","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2957720/1778612123/dc2bfcc2ce0a99af3addffa4e4d7f0abfc0b31e7/1768582787/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768583744","id":257099743,"name":"Accolades Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099743/2e691850f32102ef894f79310463fac9e